/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
bin/
wasm-pack.log

# pkg/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the wasm-pack output is committed so the
# workspace type-checks and tests without a Rust toolchain. Refresh it with
# `npm run build.wasm` in packages/nativescript-wasm-fixture — that script also
# deletes the `.gitignore` wasm-pack drops into pkg/ on every build.
